meta {
  name: Get Booking
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/bookings/1
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  # Get Booking by ID

  Retrieves a specific booking by its ID.

  ## URL Parameters
  - `booking_id`: The ID of the booking to retrieve

  ## Response
  Returns full BookingResponse object with all fields including:
  - Association (trip_day_id, activity_id)
  - Booking type and name
  - Provider information
  - Confirmation details
  - Cost and currency
  - Date and time
  - Location information
  - Contact details
  - Status and notes
  - Timestamps (created_at, updated_at as Unix timestamps)

  ## Example Response
  ```json
  {
    "id": 1,
    "trip_day_id": 1,
    "activity_id": null,
    "booking_type": "accommodation",
    "name": "Park Hyatt Tokyo",
    "provider": "Hyatt Hotels Corporation",
    "confirmation_number": "PH2025010104",
    "booking_reference": "HYATT-JP-001",
    "cost": 45000.0,
    "currency": "JPY",
    "booking_date": "2025-01-01",
    "booking_time": "15:00",
    "location": "Park Hyatt Tokyo",
    "location_address": "3-7-1-2 Nishi Shinjuku...",
    "contact_phone": "+81-3-5322-1234",
    "contact_email": "tokyo.park@hyatt.com",
    "booking_url": "https://...",
    "status": "confirmed",
    "notes": "Check-in: 3:00 PM...",
    "created_at": 1704672000,
    "updated_at": 1704672000
  }
  ```

  ## Access Control
  - Requires authentication
  - User must own the trip
  - Returns 403 Forbidden if unauthorized
  - Returns 404 Not Found if booking doesn't exist
}
